%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5c11a1209a15a4b3284cce7e980dce71, type: 3}
  m_Name: Story
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Voidward.Data::Voidward.Data.StoryDef
  DejaVu:
  - Speaker: VEGA
    Text: Wormhole exit... again? We were here. I remember this light.
  - Speaker: LYRA
    Text: Same stars, same silence. Third time? Fourth? Logbook says we keep coming back.
  - Speaker: ALTAIR
    Text: Again. Fine. We know the way now - let's make it count this time.
  - Speaker: DENEB
    Text: The loop holds us, but it can't take what we remember. Go.
  Echoes:
  - Galaxy: 1
    MinLoop: 2
    Speaker: ECHO // VEGA
    Text: 'If you hear this: keep the Nostos whole. Lose her and the loop starts over.'
  - Galaxy: 1
    MinLoop: 3
    Speaker: ECHO // LYRA
    Text: Exotic Matter first, sightseeing later. The tank decides how far we get.
  - Galaxy: 2
    MinLoop: 2
    Speaker: ECHO // ALTAIR
    Text: Andromeda's Wardens keep a Mk III core. Clear the enclave before you warp on.
  - Galaxy: 2
    MinLoop: 4
    Speaker: ECHO // VEGA
    Text: Swarms everywhere here. Stay in the ship until the guns are better.
  - Galaxy: 3
    MinLoop: 2
    Speaker: ECHO // DENEB
    Text: Nebulae blind the nav. Throttle down in the fields - a hull breach costs more time.
  - Galaxy: 4
    MinLoop: 2
    Speaker: ECHO // LYRA
    Text: Leo I is dark. Something hunts between the stars. Keep the shields up.
  - Galaxy: 5
    MinLoop: 2
    Speaker: ECHO // ALTAIR
    Text: The last enclave holds the Home Drive. Without it the flight home takes forever.
  - Galaxy: 6
    MinLoop: 2
    Speaker: ECHO // VEGA
    Text: The Rift wakes near the end. Don't drop out, don't slow down. Just fly.
  LogLoopStart: Loop {loop}. Woke at the wormhole exit in {galaxy}. Home ETA {eta}.
  LogGalaxy: Reached {galaxy}. Home ETA {eta}.
  LogWarden: Wardens of {galaxy} defeated.
  LogDrive: Installed {part}. Home ETA {eta}.
  LogShipLost: Lost the {ship}.
  LogHomeLost: The {ship} broke apart in {galaxy}. Nothing left to fly home in.
  LogFlightHome: Left {galaxy} for home. The Rift is waking.
  LogCrewLost: The whole crew was lost in {galaxy}.
  LogRiftCaught: The Rift caught us on the flight home.
  LogHomecoming: Home. Sol is outside the window.
  ResetCrewLost: Crew lost
  ResetRiftCaught: Caught by the Rift
  ResetHomeLost: Nostos destroyed
